title: "FIESTA Galaxy workflows — scattering-transform reproductions on Galaxy"
message: >-
  If you use these workflows, please cite this repository together with
  Delouis et al. 2022 (scattering method) and the FIESTA chain repos
  whose published results these workflows reproduce.
